*************************** STATUS CODE *********************

enum ArticleStatus {
  DRAFT
  PUBLISHED
  ARCHIVED
}
DRAFT=Article has been ingested and normalized.
AI processing (summary, sentiment, tags, etc.) is still pending or incomplete.
Not visible to users.

PUBLISHED=AI processing completed successfully.
Article is visible in the app.          

ARCHIVED=Article is old or intentionally removed from active feeds.
Still searchable if desired, but not shown in trending or latest sections.

